	(text "5 V tolerant LA inputs (U65, U66 = LSF0108)\nEach LA line: J1 -> TVS -> 100R -> LSF0108 -> FPGA.\nA side = FPGA, referenced to LA_VCCIO (1.8/3.3 V).\nB side = connector side, tolerates 5 V.\nEN tied to RefB, biased from +5V through 200k\n(R205/R206) with 100n (C284/C285), per TI.\nU66 channel 7 = NRST (J1 pin 22), channel 8 unused.\nTVS U22/U23/U25/U34 + U28: TPD4E05U06 (no VDD pin,\n5.5 V working voltage, +/-12 kV contact).\n100R series (0603): see the SI and ESD sims."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 347.98 83.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "62e6641c-4f1c-4941-8dfd-f0dc64b3ae86")
	)
	(text "J1 pin 21 reference (VREF_OUT)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 287.02 180.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7dd6c43b-68dd-4db0-ae07-37e62108212b")
	)
	(text "5 V tolerant (U65/U66)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "8528e320-7530-46f4-8f26-1c5e1ffc2f6e")
	)
	(text "VREF_SEL (PG5): high (default, R208) = LA_VCCIO as before, low = VREF_5V. Same polarity as U8.\nVREF_5V_EN (PG6): SY6280 on, default off (R209, EN must not float). Limit 6800/33k = ~200 mA.\nC286 10u per the SY6280 app note. Select low with EN off = pin 21 off.\nTPS2116 blocks reverse current (VOUT > VIN + 42 mV); U34 clamps VREF_OUT."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 287.02 196.85 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "be893cb7-add9-4cd1-859a-6d0fe3e14d4f")
	)
	(text "5 V tolerant inputs"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c61adb06-cad8-4742-ad4c-b14a82b47924")
	)
	(text "Signal Lines"
